/**
 * ReelRecipe — the contract between the two renderers.
 *
 * The browser canvas in /web interprets a ReelRecipe for preview.
 * The ffmpeg renderer in /service interprets the SAME ReelRecipe for export.
 * One source of truth, two renderers. If they ever diverge, that is a bug with an
 * obvious test: render both at time t and compare.
 *
 * This file has no imports and no runtime dependencies on purpose. Both sides read it.
 * Anything that varies by market, tier or type system lives in shared/rules.json and is
 * passed in, never hardcoded here.
 */

